<title>NETHERLANDS: DATES OF 14 PREVIOUS ELFSTEDENTOCHT RACES.</title>
<headline>DATES OF 14 PREVIOUS ELFSTEDENTOCHT RACES.</headline>
<dateline>LEEUWARDEN, Netherlands 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The legendary Dutch Elfstedentocht (Eleven Cities Tour) skating marathon will take place on Saturday, for only the 15th time this century.</p>
<p>Some 16,000 entrants will set off from 5.30am (0430 GMT) to skate the 200-km (125-mile) route along frozen canals and inland waterways in sub-zero temperatures in the northern province of Friesland.</p>
<p>Following are the dates of the previous &quot;Tour of Tours&quot; with the number of starters and finishers.</p>
<p>    Jan 2,  1909 -     23 started. Nine finished.</p>
<p>    Feb 7,  1912 -     60		 18</p>
<p>    Jan 27, 1917 -    150		 92</p>
<p>    Feb 12, 1929 -    304		114</p>
<p>    Dec 16, 1933 -    512		378</p>
<p>    Jan 30, 1940 -  3,404		 69</p>
<p>    Feb 6,  1941 -  2,500	    1,737</p>
<p>    Jan 22, 1942 -  4,832	    3,946</p>
<p>    Feb 8,  1947 -  2,068		309</p>
<p>    Feb 3,  1954 -  2,735	    2,206</p>
<p>    Feb 14, 1956 -  6,329	    4,848</p>
<p>    Feb 18, 1963 -  9,862		126</p>
<p>    Feb 21, 1985 - 16,456	   13,060</p>
<p>    Feb 26, 1986 - 17,316	   14,989</p>
